# skipprd release

Plugin crate `version` in sibling **skipprd-plugins** `plugins/**/Cargo.toml` is the CDN path (`plugins/<stem>/versions/<crate>/`). Those paths are immutable. This repo has no `plugins/` tree.

Tagging or publishing skipprd when plugin checksum inputs changed (`skipprd-plugins/plugins/<crate>/`, `plugins/shared/`, `crates/skippr-runtime-sdk/**`) without a new crate patch is illegal. Run:

```bash
python3 ../skipprd-plugins/.github/scripts/bump_changed_plugin_crates.py --base <last-engine-tag>
python3 .github/scripts/runtime_plugin_release_plan.py
```

Everyday plugin commits do **not** bump. `/skippr-release` does. Skill: **`skippr-release`**. Public copy: **`skipprd-docs`**.

MUST NOT `--no-verify`, MUST NOT `aws s3 sync --delete`, MUST NOT stamp root `Cargo.toml` locally (CI stamps the tag; crate stays `0.1.0`).
